  "description": "Janglim is an embeddable LALR(1) parser-generator engine for .NET. Define grammars in C# or EBNF text, tokenize and parse input, and inspect parse tables, FIRST/FOLLOW sets, parse traces, syntax trees, and conflicts. Includes incremental reparsing and opt-in, pluggable error recovery.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Janglim",
