  "published": "2026-10-10T18:44:58.933Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Janglim 0.3.0 official engine release. Includes C# grammars and EBNF text with grouping and *, +, ? operators; parsing-table, FIRST/FOLLOW, trace, and conflict introspection; incremental reparsing; and opt-in, pluggable error recovery. Parse-tree and AST debug dumps use a shared StringBuilder for O(n) rendering with unchanged output. LALRParser is supported; SLR and CLR remain experimental, and the public API may evolve during 0.x. Playground 1.0.0 has independent versioning at https://janglim.mythosia.net; its browser UI is not a NuGet runtime dependency.",
